WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.101 --> 00:00:02.851
(ethereal music)

00:00:11.888 --> 00:00:14.882
- [Voiceover] Mosha lost her leg

00:00:14.882 --> 00:00:17.123
when she was two years old,

00:00:17.123 --> 00:00:18.290
from landmine.

00:00:21.007 --> 00:00:24.757
I thought that I should
do something for her.

00:00:26.488 --> 00:00:27.995
- [Voiceover] Dr. Therdchai Jivacate

00:00:27.995 --> 00:00:30.596
is working with the world's
first elephant hospital

00:00:30.596 --> 00:00:32.772
located in Thailand.

00:00:32.772 --> 00:00:36.247
Since it opened, more than
4,000 injured and sick elephants

00:00:36.247 --> 00:00:38.228
have been treated.

00:00:38.228 --> 00:00:41.713
- I am the first one who
invented the artificial leg

00:00:41.713 --> 00:00:43.130
for the elephant.

00:00:45.237 --> 00:00:47.935
(grinding)

00:00:47.935 --> 00:00:50.035
(zapping)

00:00:50.035 --> 00:00:52.758
- [Voiceover] Using his knowledge
as an orthopedic surgeon,

00:00:52.758 --> 00:00:55.765
Dr. Therdchai designed
Mosha's artificial limb

00:00:55.765 --> 00:00:57.268
when she was just a baby,

00:00:57.268 --> 00:01:00.741
accounting for the
elephant's weight and size.

00:01:00.741 --> 00:01:04.007
As she has grown, pressure on
the prosthetic has increased,

00:01:04.007 --> 00:01:05.535
causing it to break,

00:01:05.535 --> 00:01:08.997
so a new one is created every few years.

00:01:08.997 --> 00:01:11.280
- This is a challenge for me too.

00:01:11.280 --> 00:01:14.544
Every time we fix it, we improve it.

00:01:14.544 --> 00:01:16.794
It's more sturdy, stronger.

00:01:18.488 --> 00:01:20.571
This not in the textbook.

00:01:21.500 --> 00:01:23.583
Sometimes, try and error.

00:01:26.988 --> 00:01:30.045
When she obey us, we give her candy,

00:01:30.045 --> 00:01:32.526
and she know where the candy is.

00:01:32.526 --> 00:01:35.859
She use her trunk to go into the pocket.

00:01:38.496 --> 00:01:41.006
(laughing)

00:01:41.006 --> 00:01:42.503
She know.

00:01:42.503 --> 00:01:44.753
(laughing)

00:01:49.650 --> 00:01:51.900
I did operation on her foot

00:01:52.975 --> 00:01:54.058
15 years ago,

00:01:55.599 --> 00:01:57.266
but she remember me.

00:01:59.623 --> 00:02:02.015
She like to come closer to me.

00:02:02.015 --> 00:02:04.932
She show desire of salute or happy.

00:02:09.874 --> 00:02:13.448
I think this means so much for her.

00:02:13.448 --> 00:02:15.615
She can lead a normal life

00:02:16.756 --> 00:02:18.173
as she should be.

00:02:20.485 --> 00:02:22.902
(slow music)

